\* Mutant: the watermark advances even when the PR list had gaps (before
\* listComplete).  A missing PR older than a listed one is never listed again.
\* Converged must fail.
\* Other @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 2
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 1
    MaxHourly = 2
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    AdvanceNeedsFullList = FALSE
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = @SaveRule@
    CapAtListTime = @CapAtListTime@
    ClockAhead = FALSE
    SameSecondUpdates = FALSE
    WithRepoAdd = FALSE
    WithPageRefresh = FALSE
    PartialListing = TRUE
INVARIANTS TypeOK Converged
